flowchart LR
    subgraph SOURCES[Sources]
        GUIDEBOOK[Client Guidebook]
        PUBLIC_EVIDENCE[Verified public evidence]
        CATALOGUE[The Ground organisation-scoped catalogue]
        VISITOR_FORM[Visitor interest form]
    end

    subgraph PRODUCT_RUNTIME[Product and runtime]
        EVIDENCE_REGISTER[Evidence register]
        TYPED_CONTENT[Typed bilingual content]
        BILINGUAL_INTERFACE[Brand and Guidebook interface]
        EVENT_ADAPTER[Server-only event adapter]
        PROGRAMME_INTERFACE[Homepage and programme interface]
        WEBSITE_API[Validated website API]
        QUEUE[Cloudflare Queue]
        OPENNEXT[OpenNext Worker runtime]
        R2_CACHE[R2 incremental cache<br/>Never stores lead submissions]
        REVALIDATION[Durable Object revalidation coordination]
    end

    subgraph DESTINATIONS[Destinations]
        BOOKING[Canonical The Ground booking page]
        PRIVATE_CONSUMER[Private consumer Worker]
        GOOGLE_SHEET[Client-owned Google Sheet]
    end

    GUIDEBOOK --> EVIDENCE_REGISTER
    PUBLIC_EVIDENCE --> EVIDENCE_REGISTER
    EVIDENCE_REGISTER --> TYPED_CONTENT
    TYPED_CONTENT --> BILINGUAL_INTERFACE

    CATALOGUE --> EVENT_ADAPTER
    EVENT_ADAPTER --> PROGRAMME_INTERFACE
    PROGRAMME_INTERFACE --> BOOKING

    VISITOR_FORM --> WEBSITE_API
    WEBSITE_API -->|Genuine non-honeypot submissions only| QUEUE
    QUEUE --> PRIVATE_CONSUMER
    PRIVATE_CONSUMER --> GOOGLE_SHEET

    BILINGUAL_INTERFACE -.->|Served by| OPENNEXT
    PROGRAMME_INTERFACE -.->|Served by| OPENNEXT
    WEBSITE_API -.->|Handled by| OPENNEXT
    OPENNEXT -.->|Incremental cache only| R2_CACHE
    OPENNEXT -.->|Coordinates revalidation| REVALIDATION

